{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story Background:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The war between the human race and the demon race has raged on for years. The demon army, led by the former Demon King, once captured the headquarters of the human empire. However, at a critical moment, the people united and not only defended their homeland but also launched a counterattack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What's more, as the Demon Clan retreated in defeat, the former Demon King suddenly vanished. Thus, the new Demon King, Petrick, was entrusted with the heavy responsibility...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A classic turn-based SRPG system that requires strategic planning and careful consideration;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 20 diverse demon girls, with rich cultivation elements, offering a variety of experiences;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hundreds of weapons, skills, and enhancement items, allowing for free combination to create your own strongest lineup;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Balancing both casual and hardcore players, even newcomers to tactical RPGs can easily complete the game; For experienced players, the game also features various challenges, conquer them to earn generous rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keybindings:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Select/Confirm key: Z</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cancel key: X</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For more details, refer to the game.ini file in the game folder (open with Notepad to customize keybindings).</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3762040?t=1769150872","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3762040?t=1769150872","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3762040/2316fd49a7f7011be6270161ec061a8443389a9e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769150872","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3762040/2316fd49a7f7011be6270161ec061a8443389a9e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769150872","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story Background:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The war between the human race and the demon race has raged on for years. The demon army, led by the former Demon King, once captured the headquarters of the human empire. However, at a critical moment, the people united and not only defended their homeland but also launched a counterattack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What's more, as the Demon Clan retreated in defeat, the former Demon King suddenly vanished. Thus, the new Demon King, Petrick, was entrusted with the heavy responsibility...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A classic turn-based SRPG system that requires strategic planning and careful consideration;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 20 diverse demon girls, with rich cultivation elements, offering a variety of experiences;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hundreds of weapons, skills, and enhancement items, allowing for free combination to create your own strongest lineup;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Balancing both casual and hardcore players, even newcomers to tactical RPGs can easily complete the game; For experienced players, the game also features various challenges, conquer them to earn generous rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keybindings:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Select/Confirm key: Z</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cancel key: X</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For more details, refer to the game.ini file in the game folder (open with Notepad to customize keybindings).</p>","developers":["\u5c0f\u95f2"],"genres":[{"description":"Indi